    "metaDescription": "Learn how the federal gift tax works, key annual exclusion limits, lifetime exemptions, and proven tax-free wealth transfer strategies.",
    "keywords": "Gift tax, annual exclusion, lifetime gift tax exemption, IRS Form 709, tax-free wealth transfer",
